# memory_cnn with NO curriculum and goals only in the TOP band, 8-10 m, from step one
# (2026-09-25, Joana: "one with only 10 m goals"). The control in the other direction
# from memory_cnn_uniform: no easy goals at all. The 2026-08 fixed-6 m arms never
# learned (Arm A 9.5%, Arm B 0% at 285k); this asks whether that still holds with
# box memory, the coverage cutoff and the corrected step budget. 8-10 is the band the
# ramped arms END at, so its curve is directly comparable to their plateau.
ENCODER=nature
IMGFIX=0
BOXMEM=5
BOXMEMAGG=mean
COLLAHEAD=0.7
GOALRANGE=8,10
GOALDIST_START=              # empty = no curriculum
# Coverage rule (2026-09-25, Joana): terminate below 0.4, graded cost below 0.7.
# COH raised 10 -> 50 so the cost is felt: 50 x (0.7 - cov) x 0.01 = 0.10/step at
# cov 0.5, 0.15 at 0.4. At the base weight of 10 it was 0.02/step -- symbolic.
COHTERM=0.4
COHTAU=0.7
COH=50
MAXSTEPS=200                 # 40 + 16/m x 10 m; nothing else sets it without a curriculum
GPUS=4
